## Installation

{% install primitive="lightbox" /%}

## Examples

{% examples primitive="lightbox" /%}

A hovered or pressed stage image doesn't change. To dim it on hover, put `data-ui="group"` on each slide and `--group-filter--hover: brightness(0.8)` on its image.

